voice_output.description:
**Current bindings (including changes in this session)**

{bindings}

Choose a satellite OR device and its output to add or replace a binding. The output must be exposed to Assist and support volume. Voice-user permissions are checked at runtime. To remove, select only an existing binding. Submit to update this list and keep adding. Submit an empty form to save all changes and close, or select Save and finish. Session changes take effect only when finished.

identity_binding.description:
**Current bindings (including changes in this session)**

{bindings}

Choose a satellite OR device and a user to add or replace a binding. To remove, select only an existing binding. Submit to update the list and add the next one. Submit an empty form to save all changes and close, or select Save and finish. Changes take effect only when finished. Identity selects permissions, not audio output. Authenticated identity always takes precedence.
